Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.08,0:09:20.29,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭圆_GBK\fs50\pos(908,455)}取餐口                                    點餐口
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn@方正兰亭中粗黑_GBK\be20\fr-90\fs90\fsp20\c&H000000\t(1000,1250,\be0)\move(412,723,563,723,0,2440)}可疑人員出沒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fn@方正兰亭圆_GBK\be20\fr-90\fs60\c&H000000\t(1000,1250,\be0)\move(22,85,175,85)}為了避免遭受損害\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h請充分留意對孩童搭話的人
